        given-names: Robert
    journal: Molecular Biology and Evolution
    volume: 37
    issue: 5
    year: 2020
    doi: 10.1093/molbev/msaa015
    notes: >-
      The inference engine this server drives, and academic software that expects
      to be cited. Cite IQ-TREE 2 — and the substitution-model selection or
      bootstrap method actually used — for any published result; citing the
      wrapper does not discharge that. A corrigendum exists at
      10.1093/molbev/msaa131.
